{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Reject cores that cannot forward the invocation-local carrier**\n\nThe OTel package still accepts core 2.4\u20132.6, whose `InvocationInfo` never contains `xRayTraceId`. On LMI this branch therefore consumes a potentially stale `_X_AMZN_TRACE_ID`, attaching spans and sampling decisions to another invocation. Require core 2.7+ for this feature, or version the plugin contract so older hosts are rejected or use the ARN fallback instead of the process-wide header.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs7-Iefd","finding_digest":"7e75ebf10d41d9647a91b0f12c7a68203adaac2222feb9b1ce37ec5b543a20d5","finding_id":"arf_v1_pz26x4inihmwi6urwdysy6tiea","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/package.json::core-peer::layer-host-compatibility-enforcement","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/package.json::core-peer::layer-host-compatibility-enforcement","line":212,"observation_digest":"1be048d3c6f44c4d546469b3b21a38eefdcd9ac83b07d95ca8288e5205e96bb4","observation_id":"aro_v1_dpqeru6g6rge2vdengz3egry53","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/context-extractors.ts","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_pz26x4inihmwi6urwdysy6tiea","published_at":"2026-10-13T20:25:03Z","review_id":"arr_v1_3o5uqoqidudaohjwdiprzd4li4","reviewed_base_sha":"96e77ccadbc193e0f624d2ae1acee45b56c38313","reviewed_head_sha":"ac9bec2b446e17722fec0eac9863a3dd198dcad7","reviewer":"codex","start_line":212,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":955},"record_id":"art_v1_syx36geynywuvlurg4ahj5qayx","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-13T20:25:03Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
